:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the Enemy Unit, see [[Belial (Enemy)]].''
'''Belial''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Crash Fever Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 327
|rarity = SR
|name1 = Belial
|name2 = Reckless Belial
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Reckless Belial''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Belial has somewhat decent stats, but is bogged down by his high cost and even higher recharge time. On top of that, his strengthen barely increases his damage, and he has no abilities to help him survive an enemy's attacks, like [[Survive]] or [[Strong Against|Strong]]. To put it bluntly, he's not really good.

{{Job|Classification = Midranger & User Rank Dump}}

